Python and other project files are MIT, following the upstream split.

Changes: independent Valve platform/namespace, position integration from a
movement anchor, immediate movement state publication, current-position refresh
before commands, stopping at an equal moving target, timing reset for repeated
manual endpoint commands, duration validation, and deterministic runtime tests.
Added start_position (asis/closed/open) and percentage end_positions_overrun,
with full startup travel excluding overrun and bounded repeated endpoint commands.
Added per-command continuous/pulsed positioning, separate opening/closing pulse
and pause durations, powered-time position accounting, uninterrupted endpoint
overrun, and deterministic pulse/command-interruption tests.
